"alt://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t39.30808-6/834499838_1598005922344415_3934193343683380722_n.jpg|Thank you to Kennesaw City Council member Madelyn Orochena for inviting me to the Interfaith Peace Breakfast last week. What a wonderful way to start the day! Bringing communities together to make our world a better place is a privilege, and I am so grateful everyday for this amazing job opportunity!",
"alt://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t39.30808-6/836045310_1599447188866955_6576783195303074447_n.jpg|It's not too late to help get this train into its station! 🚂 We have 4 weekends left to canvass, phone bank, and advocate for a change here in District 37, so join us! Every vote counts.",
"alt://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/834678053_18124768598490927_8641025574356696051_n.jpg|Every endorsement means a lot to me, but there’s something especially meaningful when people who know me personally step up to vouch for me. Teri is a wonderful person and a dear friend, and I’m incredibly grateful for her kind words and support. ❤️ When I have the honor of representing District 37, I promise to be the same person at the Gold Dome that I am every day: someone who serves, listens, and puts people first. That’s the kind of leader I want to be—and the kind of representative our community deserves. #LeadershipThatPutsPeopleFirst #LeadWithLove #TeamCastro #PublicServant #GeorgiaSenateDems #JoyfulResistance #UseYourVoice",
"alt://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/837888061_18124785149490927_6923056345880995752_n.jpg|While my weekends are so busy, my Sunday mornings are sacred. Time in reflection with my church family is precious to me. Congratulations to Kirkwood on 40 years of service to our community. Thank you for always being my safe space to land on Sundays! ❤️🙏🏽🥰",
